{"title":"Unparalleled ??? Rank Hidden Equipment","synopsis":"Seorang pemuda bernama Jinfrey, memutuskan untuk menjadi seorang petualang untuk menghasilkan banyak uang dan membuat keluarganya bahagia.\n\nNamun, saat ia mencoba menjadi seorang petualang, Jinfrey mengingat kenangan dari kehidupan sebelumnya. Dunia tempat Jinfrey lahir dan dibesarkan, sama persis dengan dunia “Ground Seven”, sebuah game ampas yang pernah ia mainkan di kehidupan sebelumnya sampai ia dijuluki “Hardcore Player”!\n\nMeskipun bingung dengan kenangan yang tiba-tiba bangkit, dengan menggunakan pengetahuan ini, Jinfrey bertujuan untuk menjadi tak tertandingi dengan bantuan “Hidden Equipment” di dunia ini.","alternative_title":"？？？階的隱藏裝備無雙","author":"Kiyoro","artist":"SORAJIMA","genres":["Action","Adventure","Shounen"],"chapters":[{"id":"f6c9ee99-c29b-4a70-9842-5fa13cd6f8b7","number":"94","title":"Chapter 94","date":"2026-04-19","images":[]},{"id":"1c5bce1e-4452-4297-b862-239644fd7b13","number":"93","title":"Chapter 93","date":"2026-04-18","images":[]},{"id":"9d8a8fa4-e1f4-4429-9243-428cf0a10d6a","number":"92","title":"Chapter 92","date":"2026-04-17","images":[]},{"id":"079a8de0-f7f2-46b1-aef9-1c4968ae2f64","number":"91","title":"Chapter 91","date":"2026-04-16","images":[]},{"id":"0694782c-1e47-45f5-b19d-a2af1106fdba","number":"90","title":"Chapter 90","date":"2026-04-15","images":[]},{"id":"db99bb32-e88e-41b5-a144-0bc2be811511","number":"89","title":"Chapter 89","date":"2026-04-14","images":[]},{"id":"30d8f4b3-2728-47fb-b370-8e38b7bd5dfd","number":"88","title":"Chapter 88","date":"2026-04-13","images":[]},{"id":"9396111a-d10d-49c8-b6e4-48a74523a799","number":"87","title":"Chapter 87","date":"2026-03-01","images":[]},{"id":"c74053d7-d673-4b76-9e44-72d60f0005fe","number":"86","title":"Chapter 86","date":"2026-02-28","images":[]},{"id":"530d3d37-d51e-43e0-b1bd-25be148ca8ef","number":"85","title":"Chapter 85","date":"2026-02-27","images":[]},{"id":"27ff2c1d-09a2-4af0-b261-f84a35d65b87","number":"8